            <fr:title text="Displayed Category of Isomorphisms">Displayed Category of Isomorphisms</fr:title>
            <fr:taxon>Definition</fr:taxon>
          </fr:frontmatter>
          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>Given a <fr:link href="/sss-00EC/" title="Category" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/sss-00EC/" display-uri="sss-00EC" type="local">category</fr:link> <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathcal {C}]]></fr:tex>, we define a
<fr:link href="/sss-00EB/" title="Displayed Category" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/sss-00EB/" display-uri="sss-00EB" type="local">displayed category</fr:link> <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathsf {Iso_{C}}]]></fr:tex> over <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathcal {C} \times  \mathcal {C}]]></fr:tex> whose
objects describe isomorphisms between the two objects in the base category.
</html:p>
            <fr:tex display="block"><![CDATA[{\mathopen {}\left (\mathsf {Iso_{C}}\right )\mathclose {}}_{{\mathopen {}\left (c , c'\right )\mathclose {}}} \colonequals  c \cong  c']]></fr:tex>
